Apply only the supplied framework's sufficiency and recency criteria. Check whether demonstrations are independent and broad enough for the stated level. Keep a supervisor disagreement beside the artifact evidence and request clarification if it changes the finding. Never treat repeated copies of one artifact as independent demonstrations.
